# 33. Ek complete example

Requirement:

> Saare Accounts ka `Industry` = `Consulting` karna hai.

### Batch class

```apex
public class AccountBatch
    implements Database.Batchable<Account> {

    public Database.QueryLocator start(
        Database.BatchableContext bc
    ) {
        return Database.getQueryLocator(
            'SELECT Id, Industry FROM Account'
        );
    }

    public void execute(
        Database.BatchableContext bc,
        List<Account> scope
    ) {

        for(Account acc : scope) {
            acc.Industry = 'Consulting';
        }

        update scope;
    }

    public void finish(
        Database.BatchableContext bc
    ) {
        System.debug('Batch completed');
    }
}
```

Run:

```apex
Database.executeBatch(new AccountBatch(), 200);
```

Flow:

```text
              AccountBatch
                   |
                   ↓
               start()
                   |
                   ↓
        SELECT all Accounts
                   |
                   ↓
       Salesforce creates batches
                   |
          ┌────────┼────────┐
          ↓        ↓        ↓
       200 acc  200 acc  200 acc
          ↓        ↓        ↓
       execute  execute  execute
          ↓        ↓        ↓
       Update   Update   Update
          |
          ↓
       All done
          |
          ↓
       finish()
```

