# 🧠 One-line memory trick

Batch Apex ko bas is flow se yaad rakho:

```text
                BATCH APEX
                    |
                    ↓
              start()
          "Kya process karna?"
                    |
                    ↓
              Scope/Batches
                    |
                    ↓
              execute()
         "Actual processing karo"
                    |
                    ↓
          Multiple transactions
                    |
                    ↓
              finish()
        "Kaam complete — cleanup/
          email/next batch"
```

Aur 4 special keywords:

```text
QueryLocator   → Large data
Stateful       → State remember
AllowsCallouts → External API
AsyncApexJob   → Job tracking
```

**Sabse important concept:** Batch Apex ka purpose sirf "records ko batches mein todna" nahi hai; iska major benefit ye hai ki **har `execute()` batch ek separate transaction hota hai, jisse governor limits reset hote hain aur large-volume processing manageable hoti hai.**
